WEBVTT

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:32.293
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:35.668
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:35.909 --> 00:00:38.605
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:42.691
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:43.145 --> 00:00:46.327
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:47.157 --> 00:00:50.499
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:50.811 --> 00:00:53.449
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:53.831 --> 00:00:58.376
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:00:58.616 --> 00:01:00.514
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:05.013
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:05.454 --> 00:01:08.775
♪ Shocked by what had appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:09.161 --> 00:01:12.207
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:12.362 --> 00:01:15.647
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:19.182
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:19.276 --> 00:01:23.360
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.122
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:30.531
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:30.674 --> 00:01:33.801
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:33.841 --> 00:01:37.726
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:37.748 --> 00:01:40.591
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:40.592 --> 00:01:46.128
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:46.335 --> 00:01:50.426
♪ I promise ♪

00:01:57.855 --> 00:02:00.395
I will keep you posted on the situation.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.587
I am counting on you. And also,

00:02:04.196 --> 00:02:06.419
take care of Mo Fan when he comes out.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.080
One week is a pretty long time.

00:02:09.819 --> 00:02:10.513
Sure.

00:02:26.218 --> 00:02:28.373
This rain is unsettling.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.954
Is Patrol Squad 4 back yet?

00:02:35.205 --> 00:02:35.952
No.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:38.710
I see.

00:02:44.656 --> 00:02:47.336
Every Light Talent mage has a duty.

00:02:47.793 --> 00:02:51.086
Their duty is to release a light signal
during the emergency.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.793
Inform the outpost as soon as possible.

00:02:54.184 --> 00:02:56.771
But using communication equipments
would be more effective.

00:02:57.802 --> 00:03:01.609
Didn't you learn it at school?
Equipments will expose your position.

00:03:01.972 --> 00:03:03.905
Do you want to be monster's snack?

00:03:16.257 --> 00:03:18.982
That signal! Is a flare signal.

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:20.403
Is that from Patrol Squad 4?

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.520
There is a second flare. It's code blue!

00:03:24.683 --> 00:03:26.737
I have never seen a
code blue flare before.

00:03:26.894 --> 00:03:29.813
-Inform Officer Zhan Kong now!
-I am already standing by.

00:03:32.109 --> 00:03:34.658
Do not use the communication device.
It will expose your position.

00:03:35.041 --> 00:03:36.735
Sir, this is an emergency.

00:03:36.975 --> 00:03:39.055
Both of our Light Talent mages are dead.

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:42.179
They used their last breath
to send the flare signals.

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:44.491
What happened?

00:03:44.492 --> 00:03:46.686
We failed to send the other two flares.

00:03:47.082 --> 00:03:49.804
May the god protect Bow City!

00:03:56.495 --> 00:03:59.088
Sir, should we sound
the code blue alert now?

00:03:59.943 --> 00:04:01.249
There were supposed to be four signals.

00:04:01.627 --> 00:04:03.240
Four flares means code blood!

00:04:03.842 --> 00:04:06.736
Sir, code blood means a catastrophe!

00:04:07.832 --> 00:04:08.992
From now on,

00:04:09.078 --> 00:04:14.211
every minute you waste,
hundreds of people will die in Bow City.

00:04:14.828 --> 00:04:16.401
Send code blood now!

00:05:01.387 --> 00:05:05.417
So, the Spring won't let me use
Starchart magic so easily.

00:05:10.859 --> 00:05:11.712
However,

00:05:12.152 --> 00:05:14.752
I can't tell if it's day or night
down in here.

00:05:15.185 --> 00:05:16.759
I don't even know how long has passed.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.740
I wonder what Xiaohou and
the others are doing.

00:05:39.771 --> 00:05:40.624
An alarm?

00:05:40.835 --> 00:05:43.854
Is it a fire outbreak? Perhaps a student
with Fire Talent caused it?

00:05:44.279 --> 00:05:46.388
That won't be enough to sound an alarm.

00:05:47.291 --> 00:05:49.435
Get back into the classroom!

00:05:49.907 --> 00:05:51.897
Mr. Xue. Did anything happen?

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.659
Monsters seem to be sighted
on the street.

00:05:54.352 --> 00:05:56.410
-Monsters?
-How did it happen?

00:06:08.081 --> 00:06:08.854
Are you all right?

00:06:18.249 --> 00:06:20.319
How is this possible? Pterolycus ?

00:06:21.112 --> 00:06:22.654
Hurry up! Get inside!

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:37.590
Fire!

00:06:52.836 --> 00:06:54.156
Fiery Fist!

00:07:01.148 --> 00:07:02.828
A Nebula mage indeed.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.341
We are no match for him.

00:07:07.738 --> 00:07:09.925
Do not let your guard down.

00:07:10.157 --> 00:07:12.437
Anyone could die in
the next split-second.

00:07:20.784 --> 00:07:21.771
Report!

00:07:21.811 --> 00:07:24.164
Commander, horde of monsters
appeared inside Bow City!

00:07:24.285 --> 00:07:25.178
Impossible!

00:07:25.777 --> 00:07:26.937
Monsters in the city?

00:07:27.476 --> 00:07:29.623
The city requested for our backup.

00:07:29.971 --> 00:07:30.758
Impossible.

00:07:30.918 --> 00:07:34.544
Xuefeng Mountain is still guarded,
how did the monsters get through?

00:07:35.018 --> 00:07:36.899
We don't have the answer yet.

00:07:37.114 --> 00:07:38.700
Rally the mages,

00:07:38.828 --> 00:07:41.215
evacuate the citizens to
the safety barrier.

00:07:42.058 --> 00:07:45.083
If we send reinforcement,
the guard post on Xuefeng Mountain...

00:07:45.295 --> 00:07:48.188
The safety of the people comes first.

00:07:48.252 --> 00:07:50.639
Guarding this place is pointless.

00:07:51.242 --> 00:07:52.002
Yes!

00:07:52.671 --> 00:07:55.059
Split into two groups.
One will protect the people.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.078
The other will eliminate the monsters.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:58.630
Yes!

00:07:59.198 --> 00:08:03.128
-I am headed to the city as well.
-I am counting on you then.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.424
Please.

00:08:11.257 --> 00:08:12.564
The rain is getting worse.

00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:14.129
I need to go back home soon.

00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:31.001
Strengthen your Stardust is the only
way to reach the Nebula.

00:08:31.546 --> 00:08:34.559
That would make me a Nebula mage.

00:08:37.122 --> 00:08:41.117
If you continue your training,
the Stardust will change its nature.

00:08:41.652 --> 00:08:43.425
After accumulating a
certain amount of levels,

00:08:43.654 --> 00:08:45.921
it will become a Nebula
that is much stronger.

00:08:46.847 --> 00:08:50.792
That is how you advance from Stardust
to the level of Nebula.

00:08:51.641 --> 00:08:54.670
Does that mean I will be able to
use Starchart magic?

00:08:55.336 --> 00:08:59.876
No, advancing to Nebula is only
a way to increase your Mana.

00:09:00.273 --> 00:09:02.647
It makes your Star easier to control.

00:09:03.402 --> 00:09:05.242
In order to release a Starchart magic,

00:09:05.375 --> 00:09:08.042
you need to do the same thing
while using your Star magic.

00:09:08.313 --> 00:09:10.633
Connect seven Stars and form the Orbit?

00:09:11.571 --> 00:09:13.467
I know, I am used to it.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.250
You need to connect the Stars.

00:09:16.357 --> 00:09:19.520
But there will be 49 Stars
inside the Nebula.

00:09:20.209 --> 00:09:24.668
You must connect all of those Stars
into Orbits of seven Stars.

00:09:27.069 --> 00:09:30.668
Then, use the seven Orbits to
draw a completed Starchart.

00:09:31.216 --> 00:09:33.614
That is a long and toiling process.

00:09:37.197 --> 00:09:40.157
So that is why Miss Tang Yue
gave me this Book of Starchart.

00:09:40.738 --> 00:09:44.058
With this, even if I don't know
how to draw the Starchart,

00:09:44.633 --> 00:09:46.873
I could still use the
Starchart magic temporarily.

00:09:47.286 --> 00:09:49.166
That is so nice of her.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:51.583
Could it be that she...

00:09:52.873 --> 00:09:53.652
Mo Fan.

00:09:53.859 --> 00:09:57.127
I'll be waiting for you
as you learn to use Starchart magic.

00:09:58.526 --> 00:10:00.974
If you complete your training,

00:10:01.375 --> 00:10:02.425
I'll...

00:10:03.477 --> 00:10:04.237
Miss.

00:10:04.525 --> 00:10:06.725
Before I connect the 49 Stars,

00:10:06.885 --> 00:10:09.790
will our lips be connected as well?

00:10:11.389 --> 00:10:12.389
Silly boy.

00:10:17.492 --> 00:10:18.786
That hurts.

00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:22.625
Is this part of the ordeal from
the Sacred Spring?

00:10:24.413 --> 00:10:26.813
Fine, you'll see how I overcome you.

00:10:44.208 --> 00:10:46.219
This is bad, the sector is lost.

00:10:47.002 --> 00:10:48.877
Father, there are people in here.

00:10:49.043 --> 00:10:51.283
Mo Fan is still at the Sacred Spring.

00:10:51.628 --> 00:10:53.402
We won't be in time to save them.

00:10:59.221 --> 00:11:01.593
Damn it. We are surrounded.

00:11:17.363 --> 00:11:18.110
Father!

00:11:19.066 --> 00:11:20.951
-Father!
-Mr. Mu Zhuoyun!

00:11:24.898 --> 00:11:25.978
You have to leave now!

00:11:26.522 --> 00:11:27.674
But...

00:11:28.007 --> 00:11:28.972
Ningxue.

00:11:32.546 --> 00:11:33.172
Leave!

00:11:40.598 --> 00:11:41.504
Mo Fan.

00:11:50.796 --> 00:11:54.503
Because of his failure, we must
resort to the aggressive approach.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:57.710
We could have stayed hidden
during the operation.

00:11:58.463 --> 00:12:01.255
In the end, the Holy Court
will find out about us.

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.472
A large group of guards are
at the building.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.967
Even with pandemonium in the city,

00:12:08.009 --> 00:12:10.115
the building will still be secured.

00:12:11.128 --> 00:12:13.621
But with the Cyclops helping us,

00:12:13.957 --> 00:12:17.891
it should easy to seize the building.

00:12:17.949 --> 00:12:21.509
Do not let me down like this
worthless coward.

00:12:32.222 --> 00:12:33.497
I am almost there.

00:12:45.594 --> 00:12:46.438
What is going on?

00:12:55.606 --> 00:12:57.930
Monsters! I'll leave this to you.

00:13:01.187 --> 00:13:03.231
Hey, run if you finished your training!

00:13:11.404 --> 00:13:12.084
Run!

00:13:17.132 --> 00:13:18.052
You are...

00:13:18.105 --> 00:13:20.198
I am Lin Yuxin.
I am the Deputy Captain here.

00:13:20.424 --> 00:13:22.238
Why would the monsters come here?

00:13:22.331 --> 00:13:25.293
-There is no time for explanation.
-What is going on here?

00:13:26.828 --> 00:13:29.543
The only exit is sealed.
How do we get out?

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:06.723
Hey, what is in that thing?

00:14:07.516 --> 00:14:08.609
The Sacred Spring.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:11.112
All the spring water is in there?

00:14:11.967 --> 00:14:13.928
This is the emergency safety protocol
of the Sacred Spring.

00:14:14.258 --> 00:14:15.776
Okay, we need to go.

00:14:17.334 --> 00:14:20.043
We must not let them get their hands
on the Sacred Spring.

00:14:20.778 --> 00:14:21.672
Who are "they"?

00:14:26.608 --> 00:14:27.888
There is a chamber down here?

00:14:28.131 --> 00:14:30.056
-Where does this lead to?
-I don't know.

00:14:30.456 --> 00:14:32.309
This is an ancient tunnel.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:35.864
If we stay here, we will only starve to death
or be eaten by the monsters.

00:14:35.987 --> 00:14:36.880
Let's go.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.114
Neither won' t work out.

00:14:47.148 --> 00:14:47.988
Father.

00:14:48.404 --> 00:14:49.444
Xinxia.

00:14:54.526 --> 00:14:56.638
You mentioned not to let them
have the Sacred Spring.

00:14:56.944 --> 00:14:58.104
They are just rats.

00:14:58.443 --> 00:14:59.963
Although they are monster rats.

00:15:01.659 --> 00:15:03.088
It's not as simple as that.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.547
You haven't told me what happened.

00:15:07.334 --> 00:15:11.126
The Black Curia created the Spring of
Rage that resembles the Sacred Spring.

00:15:11.777 --> 00:15:13.004
Spring of Rage?

00:15:14.018 --> 00:15:16.578
It makes the monsters rage
with bloodlust.

00:15:17.667 --> 00:15:22.042
The Black Curia infused the Spring
of Rage with rain water.

00:15:22.745 --> 00:15:24.279
Monsters are attracted to this place.

00:15:25.115 --> 00:15:27.648
The outpost at Xuefeng Mountain is lost.

00:15:27.688 --> 00:15:28.686
How did that happen?

00:15:29.426 --> 00:15:32.288
I thought Officer Zhan Kong is
at that outpost.

00:15:33.575 --> 00:15:34.788
Even with all the Military Mages?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.522
They can't all be wiped out
in mere days.

00:15:37.824 --> 00:15:39.971
What about Bow City?
How is the situation there?

00:15:43.665 --> 00:15:44.452
I have no idea.

00:15:50.196 --> 00:15:52.390
-What do we do now?
-We need to climb up there.

00:16:01.485 --> 00:16:04.085
I must have been punched by
the Cyclops just now.

00:16:14.661 --> 00:16:15.678
This is...

00:16:17.768 --> 00:16:19.645
Isn't this the hill behind
Sky Magic High School?

00:16:20.336 --> 00:16:21.949
How do we get here?

00:17:09.744 --> 00:17:12.119
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:17:12.777 --> 00:17:16.199
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:16.469 --> 00:17:19.520
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:20.161 --> 00:17:21.641
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:22.042 --> 00:17:23.935
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:24.549 --> 00:17:27.595
♪ Dreamt that we will not
wander anymore ♪

00:17:27.927 --> 00:17:31.852
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:33.325 --> 00:17:37.250
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:38.243 --> 00:17:43.190
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:44.251 --> 00:17:47.512
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:47.824 --> 00:17:50.678
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:50.945 --> 00:17:53.270
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:53.413 --> 00:17:56.321
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:56.646 --> 00:17:59.368
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:59.503 --> 00:18:02.920
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:18:03.246 --> 00:18:05.215
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:18:05.787 --> 00:18:08.884
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:18:09.429 --> 00:18:13.268
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:13.856 --> 00:18:20.093
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
